types of AI
1. Narrow AI (weak AI)
2. General AI 
3. Theoretical AI (Super AI)

types of ML
1. supervised Learning -- learns from labeled data
2. unsupervised learning -- finds hidden patterns or grouping in       unlabeled data on its own
3. reinforcement learning -- learns by trial and error, receiving rewards  or penalties for action.

